From 9fa05a4cdd35d6273eb2a9869c608054f79ef417 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NFCSTORE CI <ci@nfcstore.uz>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:51:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 65/69] Nova: Ko'rgazma yaratish (/showcase/create)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 1–5 rasm: galereyadan bir nechta yoki kamera; olib tashlash mumkin;
  video tanlash yo'li umuman yo'q (ShowcaseImageSource faqat rasm).
- Sarlavha (≤80), tavsif, ixtiyoriy narx (faqat raqam, "125 000"),
  biznesda "Katalogdan tanlash" (sarlavha/narx/rasmlarni to'ldiradi,
  catalogItemId — tovarning satr id'si), ixtiyoriy YouTube/Instagram
  havolasi (https, mijozda tekshiriladi), musiqa (showMusicPicker,
  «Shu musiqani ishlatish» dan oldindan tanlangan), slayd 3/5/8/10 s.
- ensureContentRules yuklashdan oldin; har rasm post bilan bir xil
  yo'ldan yuklanadi, keyin SocialRepository.createShowcase (shartnoma
  §3: showcase, mediaUrls, title, priceUzs, catalogItemId, linkUrl,
  musicId, musicStart, imageSeconds, agreed, rulesVersion "2026-10").
- Jarayon chizig'i va xatolar describeError orqali.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
